Issue 01 done, committed as `4e96563` (engine/ + tsconfig.json only; `.scratch/` untouched).

**What landed** — `engine/` with public interface `engine/engine.ts` (`runPool`):
- Line-1 marker pool loading, rejects markerless/empty pools and duplicate ids (`engine/pool.ts:62`)
- Four channels with reducers: tickets (last-write), log (append), outcomes (keyed), config (static console.json)
- Super-steps: ready = all blockers done; ready set spawned in parallel against one shared snapshot; updates merged at the join; in-progress statuses emitted at super-step start
- Glued-prompt spawn (driver skill + AGENT.md + chain + roster + upstream outcomes), stdin closed, per-ticket logs in `runs/`; harness resolution injectable, claude/opencode defaults ported from run.sh (cursor deliberately left to Issue 04)
- sqlite checkpoints to `console.db` after every super-step plus terminal state
- 14 seam tests via stub harness scripts and temp pools; full suite 96 pass, `tsc --noEmit` clean

